OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order following
OL,4,Asuspected racial attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been put in place
OL,7,Fto tackle anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Ffollowing a suspected racially
OL,9,Faggravated attack in a town in West
OL,10,FYorkshire.
OL,12,FUp until Sunday at 16:00 BST, police
OL,13,Fcan exclude people from a designated
OL,14,Farea in Ossett including the
OL,15,Fpedestrianised precinct, bus station,
OL,16,FCo-op and Church Street park and skate
OL,17,Fpark.
OL,19,FThe order, authorised on Friday,
OL,20,Ffollows an attack on two people on 17
OL,21,FOctober while they were leaving Hindu
OL,22,Fcelebrations at Ossett Town Hall.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
