OL,4,Asuspected racial attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe order aims to ensure the town
OL,7,Fcentre is a "safe and welcoming place
OL,8,Ffor everyone", according to Insp Andrew
OL,9,FDickinson of the Wakefield West
OL,10,FNeighbourhood Policing Team.
